Kernel logo sources
===================

claude.svg, opencode.svg, pi.svg and gemini.svg reuse the monochrome SVGs
from Lobe Icons, commit a177c1e817204f8ddc0c8993610ca674fc6d9767:
https://github.com/lobehub/lobe-icons/tree/a177c1e817204f8ddc0c8993610ca674fc6d9767/packages/static-svg/icons
Upstream filenames: claudecode.svg, opencode.svg, pi.svg, geminicli.svg.
Only fixed intrinsic dimensions, removed browser-only inline styles, and
normalized markup; all path geometry is unchanged.

magpie.svg is the original monochrome mark from magpie, unchanged:
https://github.com/yetone/magpie/blob/36c5ee1e6ceb51d48b0565e51dfcaaedecc86eb4/internal/gui/assets/icons/magpie.svg

The marks identify their respective products. Trademark rights remain with
their respective owners.

